          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हल्ला — hallā — \"an uproar, a commotion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गली में अचानक हल्ला हुआ। galī meṁ acānak hallā huā. Suddenly there was an uproar in the lane."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हल्ला (hallā) goes back to halla, \"movement\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 14017), which lists Hindi hallā, \"tumult, noise\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
